{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499860/extras/Ps_game.gif?t=1745052478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You don\u2019t remember how you ended up here.</strong>  <br>But <strong>V.E.R.A.</strong> \u2014 the enigmatic AI overseeing your journey \u2014 is already speaking.  <br>  <br><strong>Calm.</strong>\u2003\u2003\u2003\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u2003\u2003<strong>Sharp.</strong>\u2003\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003<strong>Sarcastic. </strong> <br>  <br><strong>She</strong> tells you to drive.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>To go UP.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499860/extras/post_speed.gif?t=1745052478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Post-Speed is a racing puzzle set in a single interconnected vertical world.  <br>Just one continuous challenge.  <br>Reach higher. Solve faster. Escape \u2014 if that\u2019s even possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Open World, Racing Puzzle Hybrid</strong>  <br>Explore a vertically structured world where driving meets brainwork.  <br>Every curve, platform, and gap is part of the puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Experimental Vehicle Mechanics</strong>  <br>Rotate mid-air. Shift trajectory instantly.  <br>And, yes \u2014 use a built-in miniature time machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfad <strong>Narrative with Layers (and Wires)</strong>  <br>Who built this place? Why are you here?  <br>Why does V.E.R.A. sound like she\u2019s not just guiding, but remembering?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcac <strong>V.E.R.A., Your Reluctant Companion</strong>  <br>She\u2019ll mock. She\u2019ll admire. She\u2019ll glitch.  <br>And maybe \u2014 just maybe \u2014 she cares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>High-Speed Precision Required</strong>  <br>One wrong move can mean falling far.  <br>But failure is just another trajectory to test.  <br>  <br><strong>Find the perfect trajectory. Learn the truth.</strong>  <br><strong>And don\u2019t let V.E.R.A. erase your memory\u2026 again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to defy the simulation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Post-Speed \u2014 it\u2019s a race for truth you can\u2019t escape.</strong> \ud83e\udde9\u26a1\ud83d\ude97</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3499860?t=1745052478","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3499860?t=1745052478","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499860/bb521c8197e9008ce6c417d8d7fcb3d905db472a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745052478","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499860/bb521c8197e9008ce6c417d8d7fcb3d905db472a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745052478","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499860/extras/Ps_game.gif?t=1745052478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You don\u2019t remember how you ended up here.</strong>  <br>But <strong>V.E.R.A.</strong> \u2014 the enigmatic AI overseeing your journey \u2014 is already speaking.  <br>  <br><strong>Calm.</strong>\u2003\u2003\u2003\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0